<title>NEW ZEALAND: Wools of New Zealand appoints new chairman.</title>
<headline>Wools of New Zealand appoints new chairman.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Wools of New Zealand said on Wednesday deputy chairman Bruce Munro had been elected the board's new chairman.</p>
<p>He replaces Pat Morrison, who stood down after 10 years in the position.</p>
<p>Cromwell farmer Allan Kane replaces Munro as deputy chairman.</p>
<p>-- Wellington newsroom (64 4) 473 4746</p>
</text>
